,{"type":"text","text":" and the caller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decides whether to re-prompt and retry with a fresh "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Returning "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization\/PINReply\/cancel","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"providePIN"},{"type":"text","text":" aborts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the ceremony with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError\/cancelled(source:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a high-level passkey client that runs WebAuthn ceremonies against a YubiKey."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is the entry point for WebAuthn in this SDK. It wraps a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientDataJSON"},{"type":"text","text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCredential"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, or bio enrollment."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enforces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier doesn’t match."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"type":"text","text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the client escalates to level 2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allowedExtensions"},{"type":"text","text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the authenticator. Defaults to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s standard set."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out-of-band from the ceremony stream. Both ceremony methods return a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/StatusStream","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — drain it with "},{"code":"value()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":